# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file, patches or ignores known vulnerabilities
version: v1.25.0
ignore:
  'SNYK-JS-MAPLIBREGL-21826908':
    - '@defra/interactive-map > maplibre-gl':
        reason: 'Checked 2026-10-29 on interactive-map@0.0.54-alpha > maplibre-gl@5.24.0: the DOM.sanitize() bypass (GHSA-jrc7-96c5-q579) needs the attribution control to render untrusted attribution HTML. The parcel map sets a fixed OS attribution string (getMapStyleAttribution) and loads its style from the grants-ui /api/map/os-basemap proxy, so applicants cannot supply attribution content. The fix, maplibre-gl 6.4.1+, needs interactive-map@0.0.55-alpha, a breaking MapLibre v6 upgrade (WebGL2, separate worker file, v6 API for the direct MapLibre calls in parcel-map) that needs browser testing. Remove this ignore when that upgrade lands.'
        expires: '2026-11-28'
    - '@defra/forms-engine-plugin > maplibre-gl':
        reason: 'Checked 2026-10-29 on forms-engine-plugin@4.23.0: the engine depends on maplibre-gl ^5.24.0 directly and through interactive-map@0.0.22-alpha, and no 4.x release moves to maplibre-gl 6.4.1+. Its map.js sets fixed OS and Esri attribution strings and loads styles from the grants-ui /api/maps/vts proxy; geospatial-map.js adds GeoJSON datasets from the same API without attribution. Applicants cannot supply the attribution HTML the DOM.sanitize() bypass needs. Remove this ignore when forms-engine-plugin moves to maplibre-gl 6.4.1+; reassess if map attribution or style sources become configurable.'
        expires: '2026-11-28'
    - '@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > maplibre-gl':
        reason: 'Checked 2026-10-29 on forms-engine-plugin@4.23.0 > interactive-map@0.0.22-alpha > maplibre-gl@5.24.0: same maps as the direct forms-engine-plugin path, with fixed OS and Esri attribution strings and styles from the grants-ui /api/maps/vts proxy, so applicants cannot supply attribution HTML. No forms-engine-plugin 4.x release moves interactive-map to maplibre-gl 6.4.1+. Remove this ignore when it does; reassess if map attribution or style sources become configurable.'
        expires: '2026-11-28'
  'SNYK-JS-FOLLOWREDIRECTS-21762031':
    - '@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > @easyops-cn/docusaurus-search-local > @docusaurus/plugin-content-docs > @docusaurus/core > webpack-dev-server > http-proxy-middleware > http-proxy > follow-redirects':
        reason: 'Checked 2026-10-28 on forms-engine-plugin@4.23.0: interactive-map@0.0.22-alpha installs Docusaurus@3.10.2 > webpack-dev-server@5.2.7 > http-proxy-middleware@2.0.10 > http-proxy@1.18.1 > follow-redirects@1.16.1 in production. Custom credential disclosure requires a cross-realm sensitiveHeaders array and an attacker-controlled cross-origin redirect. Grants UI runs Hapi, not the map documentation dev server; http-proxy only uses follow-redirects when followRedirects is enabled and setupOutgoing does not forward sensitiveHeaders. Fixed follow-redirects@1.16.2 was published 2026-10-25T21:32:25.963Z; the seven-day cooldown ends 2026-11-01T21:32:25.963Z. Remove this ignore and upgrade the transitive dependency when eligible; reassess if the documentation server is enabled or this dependency path changes.'
        expires: '2026-11-02'
  'SNYK-JS-QS-21755395':
    - '@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > *':
        reason: 'Checked 2026-10-27 on forms-engine-plugin@4.23.0: interactive-map@0.0.22-alpha installs Docusaurus > webpack-dev-server@5.2.7 > express@4.22.3 > qs@6.16.1 (directly and via body-parser@1.20.8) in production. The issue is in qs.stringify when allowEmptyArrays is enabled and an attacker controls a key name. Express and body-parser only call qs.parse for query strings and urlencoded bodies; grants-ui is a Hapi app that neither imports qs nor runs webpack-dev-server or the map documentation tooling. Fixed qs@6.17.0 was published 2026-10-27T06:23:47.002Z; the seven-day cooldown ends 2026-11-03T06:23:47.002Z. Remove this ignore and bump the existing override when eligible.'
        expires: '2026-11-04'
  'SNYK-JS-PICOMATCH-21248802':
    - '@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > *':
        reason: 'Checked 2026-10-20 on forms-engine-plugin@4.23.0: interactive-map@0.0.22-alpha installs Docusaurus > globby/fast-glob/micromatch, chokidar/anymatch/readdirp and jest-util > picomatch@2.3.2 in production. ReDoS requires an attacker-controlled repeated-extglob pattern. These documentation paths use source-file and watch patterns, not applicant form values; grants-ui does not run Docusaurus. Its own build/watch tooling also uses repository-controlled patterns. No fixed picomatch release is available, including 4.0.7. Remove when a fixed version is released or the documentation dependencies are dropped; review within one month.'
        expires: '2026-11-20'
  'SNYK-JS-INFLIGHT-6095116':
    - '@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > *':
        reason: 'Rechecked 2026-10-05: forms-engine-plugin@4.23.0 brings interactive-map@0.0.22-alpha > polygon-splitter@0.0.11 > glob@8.1.0 > inflight@1.0.6. No fixed inflight release. The published polygon-splitter runtime does not import glob; its browser bundle does not load inflight. Remove when polygon-splitter drops or updates glob.'
        expires: '2026-10-31'
    - '@defra/interactive-map > polygon-splitter > glob > inflight':
        reason: 'Rechecked 2026-10-20 on interactive-map@0.0.54-alpha: polygon-splitter@0.0.11 declares glob@8.1.0 but its published runtime does not import it. No fixed inflight release; inflight is not included in the browser runtime. Remove when polygon-splitter drops or updates glob.'
        expires: '2026-10-31'
  'SNYK-JS-BRACES-19963945':
    - '@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > *':
        reason: 'Rechecked 2026-10-05 on forms-engine-plugin@4.23.0: interactive-map@0.0.22-alpha brings Docusaurus@3.10.2 > chokidar/globby > braces@3.0.3. No fixed braces release. This is the map package documentation build tooling, which grants-ui never runs or bundles for applicants. Remove when braces is fixed or upstream drops these dependencies.'
        expires: '2026-10-31'
  'SNYK-JS-HTTPCACHESEMANTICS-19964064':
    - '@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > *':
        reason: 'Rechecked 2026-10-05 on forms-engine-plugin@4.23.0: Docusaurus@3.10.2 > update-notifier@6.0.2 > got@12.6.1 > cacheable-request@10.2.14 > http-cache-semantics@4.3.0. Snyk reports no fixed release. Only used by the map documentation update notifier, which grants-ui never runs. Remove when fixed or the documentation dependencies are dropped.'
        expires: '2026-10-31'
  'SNYK-JS-HTTPCACHESEMANTICS-19964068':
    - '@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > *':
        reason: 'Rechecked 2026-10-05 on forms-engine-plugin@4.23.0: Docusaurus@3.10.2 > update-notifier@6.0.2 > got@12.6.1 > cacheable-request@10.2.14 > http-cache-semantics@4.3.0. Snyk reports no fixed release. Only used by the map documentation update notifier, which grants-ui never runs. Remove when fixed or the documentation dependencies are dropped.'
        expires: '2026-10-31'
  'SNYK-JS-URIJS-19963961':
    - '@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > *':
        reason: 'Rechecked 2026-10-05 on forms-engine-plugin@4.23.0: Docusaurus@3.10.2 > file-loader@6.2.0 > schema-utils@3.3.0 > ajv@6.15.0 > uri-js@4.4.1. No fixed release. This documentation build chain is never run by grants-ui; Ajv handles static schema identifiers, not applicant input. Remove when fixed or upstream drops the documentation dependencies.'
        expires: '2026-10-31'
  'SNYK-JS-URIJS-19963963':
    - '@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > *':
        reason: 'Rechecked 2026-10-05 on forms-engine-plugin@4.23.0: Docusaurus@3.10.2 > file-loader@6.2.0 > schema-utils@3.3.0 > ajv@6.15.0 > uri-js@4.4.1. No fixed release. This documentation build chain is never run by grants-ui; Ajv handles static schema identifiers, not applicant input. Remove when fixed or upstream drops the documentation dependencies.'
        expires: '2026-10-31'
  'SNYK-JS-SPRINTFJS-20532016':
    - 'global-agent > roarr > sprintf-js':
        reason: 'Checked 2026-10-07: global-agent@3.0.0 > roarr@2.15.4 > sprintf-js@1.1.3. No fixed sprintf-js release; the only fix is global-agent v4 (drops roarr from 4.1.0). global-agent is pinned to 3.0.0 because 4.1.3 broke the OIDC well-known fetch over the CDP egress proxy (#968, #969). Remove when global-agent v4 is re-verified in a CDP environment.'
        expires: '2026-11-06'
  'SNYK-JS-URIJS-20341609':
    - '@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > *':
        reason: 'Rechecked 2026-10-05 on forms-engine-plugin@4.23.0: Docusaurus@3.10.2 > file-loader@6.2.0 > schema-utils@3.3.0 > ajv@6.15.0 > uri-js@4.4.1. No fixed release. This documentation build chain is never run by grants-ui; Ajv handles static schema identifiers, not applicant input. Remove when fixed or upstream drops the documentation dependencies.'
        expires: '2026-10-31'
patch: {}
